cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this evaluation harness, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "Long-Term Memory Eval"
abstract: >-
  Evaluation harness for long-term conversational memory. locomo_eval scores
  one memory method on LoCoMo. experiment_runner expands a YAML matrix into
  hashed run ids and runs one cell per task. LoCoMo and the Mem0 judge
  protocol are the benchmarks; this repository did not author them.
